{
  "_doc": "Stream C/E, play-test 4 S18: the SECOND TIER of armour. From `fromLevel`, an armour piece or shield that drops (or is rolled for a shop) may come out THEMED: `tier: 2`, `theme` (an id below), a name prefix, `armor` x `armorMult`, and `look.theme` + `look.trim`/`look.glow`/`look.emblem` so D-world can draw the iconography (an emblem on the chest, shoulders and helm brow, trim in the theme colour). Which themes a piece can roll = the themes of every class that wears that armour weight (`classes.<id>.weight`), so every class can find its own. Chance per armour drop: `chance` (normal/magic), `chanceRare` (rare). Uniques, set pieces and legendaries keep their own look and are never themed. Read by js/rules/loot-pool.js (pure, seeded rng).",
